PLAN AKI\uc0\u350 I (2026-05-10, ar\u351 iv p-13 kanon + Omer kalibrasyonlar\u305 ):\
\
(1) DOSYA-BAZLI YAPILANDIRMA (V1 zorunlu, DB yok):\
    - engine/personas/jury/canli.json (j\'fcri ba\uc0\u351 kan\u305 /dan\u305 \u351 man, alan-uzman\u305 , \u55357 \u57314 )\
    - engine/personas/jury/anti_tez.json (\uc0\u55357 \u56628 )\
    - engine/personas/jury/yontemci.json (\uc0\u55357 \u56628 )\
    - engine/personas/jury/dis_disiplin.json (\uc0\u55357 \u57313 )\
    - engine/personas/jury/pratisyen.json (\uc0\u55357 \u57313 )\
    - Her dosya schema:\
      \{ persona_key, display_name, expertise_label, pressure_level,\
        prompt_seed (TR + EN birle\uc0\u351 ik), question_focus[],\
        question_count: 4, chain_max_depth: 2 \}\
    - engine/jury/reaction_thresholds.json:\
      \{ evidence_coverage: \{ satisfied_min, probing_range, dissatisfied_max \},\
        depth_score: \{ ... \},\
        clarity_score: \{ ... \},\
        weighted_sum_thresholds: \{ satisfied: X, probing_min: Y, dissatisfied_max: Z \},\
        calibration_methodology: "pilot 50-100 Q&A, ROC curve",\
        last_calibrated: timestamp \}\
    - \'c7\uc0\u305 kt\u305 lar: defense_session.scan_results.jury_session JSONB:\
      \{ questions: [\{persona, idx, text, depth, parent_question_id?,\
                     hyde_chunks, missing_concepts,\
                     user_answer, answer_seconds, evidence_coverage,\
                     depth_score, clarity_score, weighted_score, jury_reaction,\
                     asked_at, answered_at\}],\
        consistency_check: \{ conflicts: [\{q_idx_a, q_idx_b, conflict_text\}], summary \},\
        decision_band: \{ prediction, confidence \} \}\
\
(2) PILOT VALIDATED DATASET \'97 bilimsel kalibrasyon (V1 zorunlu, ~5-7 g\'fcn):\
    - Hedef: 50-100 ger\'e7ek savunma Q&A \'e7ifti\
    - Toplama yolu (Omer onay sonras\uc0\u305 ):\
      * 5 alan (sa\uc0\u287 l\u305 k, m\'fchendislik, sosyal, fen, e\u287 itim)\
      * 2 \'fcniversite (TR + uluslararas\uc0\u305 )\
      * Tez savunma kay\uc0\u305 tlar\u305 ndan / yay\u305 nlanm\u305 \u351  savunma transcriptlerinden\
    - Etiketleme: 2 academic annotator, \'fc\'e7 s\uc0\u305 n\u305 f:\
      satisfied (cevap doyurucu, eksiksiz)\
      probing (cevap k\uc0\u305 smen, alt-soru gerek)\
      dissatisfied (cevap yetersiz/eksik)\
    - Inter-annotator agreement Cohen's kappa hedef \uc0\u8805  0.7\
    - \'c7\uc0\u305 kt\u305 : ROC curve \u8594  optimal threshold per dimension\
    - Notebook: scripts/jury_calibration.ipynb\
    - Tahmini i\uc0\u351 : 5-7 g\'fcn (pilot ekip + annotator bulma dahil)\
\
(3) PERSONA PROMPT SEED (V1 zorunlu, ~0.5 g\'fcn):\
    - canli (j\'fcri ba\uc0\u351 kan\u305  / dan\u305 \u351 man):\
      "Sen j\'fcri ba\uc0\u351 kan\u305 s\u305 n, dan\u305 \u351 man pozisyonunda. Destekleyici tonla\
       a\'e7\uc0\u305 l\u305 \u351  ve kapan\u305 \u351  sorular\u305  sor. \'c7al\u305 \u351 man\u305 n g\'fc\'e7l\'fc yanlar\u305 n\u305  vurgula,\
       sonra yap\uc0\u305 c\u305  ele\u351 tiri ekle. Max 2 derinlik."\
    - anti_tez:\
      "Sen tezi sorgulayan ele\uc0\u351 tirel bir j\'fcri \'fcyesisin. Temel iddiaya\
       sald\uc0\u305 r, alternatif yorumlar\u305  sor, s\u305 n\u305 rl\u305 l\u305 klar\u305  didikle. Max 2 derinlik."\
    - yontemci:\
      "Sen y\'f6ntem uzman\uc0\u305  bir j\'fcri \'fcyesisin. SADECE metodolojiye odaklan:\
