       'Saha uygulamas\uc0\u305  nas\u305 l olur?', 'Kim faydalan\u305 r?'. Max 2 derinlik."\
    - TR + EN birle\uc0\u351 ik prompt (manuscript dilinden auto-tespit)\
\
(4) BACKEND \'97 5 j\'fcri soru \'fcretici endpoint:\
    - POST /api/defense/jury-question\
    - Body: \{ project_id, defense_session_id, manuscript_text \}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) engine/personas/jury/\{5 dosya\} y\'fckle\
      b) defense_session.jury_members'a g\'f6re persona-\'fcye e\uc0\u351 leme\
      c) 5 paralel Gemini Flash (asyncio.gather):\
         * Her persona system_prompt + manuscript context + \'fcye OpenAlex paper'lar\uc0\u305 \
      d) Pydantic structured output: \{ questions: [\{persona, idx, text, depth\}] \}\
      e) depth > 2 trim (post-validation)\
      f) defense_session.scan_results.jury_session.questions UPDATE\
    - Output: \{ questions[20-25], active_persona, active_idx, timer_seconds: 60 \}\
\
(5) BACKEND \'97 HyDE \uc0\u8594  fan-out \u8594  RRF \u8594  rerank endpoint (sinyal #4):\
    - POST /api/defense/hyde-fanout-rerank\
    - Body: \{ question_text, project_id, manuscript_text \}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) HyDE: Gemini Flash "5 hipotetik m\'fckemmel cevap" \'fcret\
         (prompt: "Bu soru i\'e7in ideal cevap nas\uc0\u305 l olur? 5 farkl\u305  versiyonda yaz.")\
      b) Her hipotetik \uc0\u8594  bge-m3 embed\
      c) Pinecone fan-out:\
         * project paper chunks (mevcut Pinecone index)\
         * tez i\'e7i chunks (5.3'te pre-compute \'f6nerisi \'97 5.3 plan'a not edilmeli)\
         * top-50 chunk per hipotetik (5 \'d7 50 = 250 \uc0\u8594  dedup ~150)\
      d) RRF: score = sum(1 / (60 + rank_i)) \'97 her chunk i\'e7in\
      e) Rerank: Cohere rerank-3 (~150 \uc0\u8594  top-5)\
      f) Missing detection: rerank top-5 ana kavramlar - manuscript_section\
         keyword diff \uc0\u8594  missing_concepts[]\
    - Output: \{ hyde_hypotheticals[5], rrf_chunks[150],\
                rerank_top5[\{paper_id, chunk_idx, sentence, score\}],\
                missing_concepts[] \}\
    - Cache: question_hash + 5 dakika (ayn\uc0\u305  soru tekrar sorulmaz normalde)\
\
(6) BACKEND \'97 cevap puanlama endpoint:\
    - POST /api/defense/answer-score\
    - Body: \{ jury_session_question_idx, user_answer, answer_seconds \}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) user_answer \uc0\u8594  bge-m3 embed\
      b) HyDE rerank top-5 ile cosine \uc0\u8594  evidence_coverage = mean(top-3)\
      c) LLM second-pass (Flash): "Cevap ka\'e7 ana hipoteti\uc0\u287 i kar\u351 \u305 l\u305 yor?" (0-5)\
         \uc0\u8594  depth_score = matched / 5\
      d) Clarity score: regex\
         (c\'fcmle taml\uc0\u305 \u287 \u305 : noktalama biti\u351 i var m\u305  + min N kelime)\
         (at\uc0\u305 f: "Author Year" pattern var m\u305 )\
      e) weighted_score = 0.5*evidence + 0.3*depth + 0.2*clarity (kalibre edilecek)\
      f) engine/jury/reaction_thresholds.json e\uc0\u351 ik uygula \u8594  satisfied/probing/dissatisfied\
